    "language": "en",
    "text": " Transcription needs to be transcribed often. Yes, especially when it comes to natural dialogue or something related to a natural dialogue, for example in the market or among friends or in some party or some interview. So transcriptionism is something also useful that I use in teaching. I have a blog that is focusing on transcription or transcribing texts, news texts actually. So it helps the students and the learners to achieve some level of proficiency in the sounds and in the articulation of the sounds and in reading skills."
